o<probe_wake> sub
; Wake the GP-800 wireless probe and wait for its radio link.
; Each call (re)starts the 2 min power hold (probe-power-hold in the main HAL).
; Call this before any hand-written G38 - motion.probe-input reads 'tripped'
; while the probe isn't ready, so G38 is refused rather than crashing.
M64 P8                  ; wake request (rising edge retriggers the hold)
G4 P0.05
M65 P8
M66 P10 L3 Q15          ; probe-ready: powered > 3 s AND link OK
o1 if [#5399 LT 0]
  (abort, wireless probe not ready - no radio link within 15s)
o1 endif
o<probe_wake> endsub
M2
